    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolPick">Pick</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolMoveShort">Drags the selected layer in the picture. Corners resize, the grip above rotates. Double-click centres it again.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolSelectShort">Clicking an object creates a cryptomatte. Its settings live with the layer's mask section.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolSelectNodesShort">Clicking an object adds it to the selected cryptomatte node – a second click removes it again.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolCropShort">Drags the crop edges of the selected layer. The faint frame shows what is being cut away. Double-click undoes the crop.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S_ToolHandShort">Pans the view. The middle mouse button does the same anywhere, without switching tools.</sys:String>
